id:"p18", num:18, title:"Databases & SQL: Modeling, Querying, Internals & Administration", short:"SQL",
tagline:"Store every fact exactly once, ask any question in SQL, understand what the engine does with your query, run PostgreSQL like a professional, and know when a table is the wrong shape.",
